#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:1
msgid "HM-G51B"
msgstr "HM-G51B"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:3
msgid "产品定位"
msgstr "Product overview"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:6
msgid ""
"**面向独立 GNSS 定位和紧凑型终端集成的单频多星座 GNSS 接收机模组。** 通过 "
"UART 输出 UBX-NAV-PVT 定位数据，不需要差分基站或 CORS 服务。"
msgstr ""
"**A single-band multi-constellation GNSS receiver module for standalone "
"positioning and compact-system integration.** It outputs UBX-NAV-PVT data "
"over UART without requiring an RTK base station or CORS service."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:9
msgid "HM-G51B 单频多星座 GNSS 接收机模组"
msgstr "HM-G51B Single-Band Multi-Constellation GNSS Receiver Module"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:14
msgid "核心价值"
msgstr "Key benefits"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:16
msgid "**定位链路简洁**：无需 4G、LoRa、CORS 账号或本地基站。"
msgstr ""
"**Simple positioning architecture**: Requires no 4G, LoRa, CORS account, or "
"local base station."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:17
msgid "**紧凑轻量**：模组尺寸 26.5 × 35.5 × 7.1 mm，重量 10 g。"
msgstr ""
"**Compact and lightweight**: Measures 26.5 × 35.5 × 7.1 mm and weighs 10 g."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:18
msgid ""
"**多星座单频接收**：支持 GPS、北斗、Galileo、QZSS 和 GLONASS 的 L1 频段信号。"
msgstr ""
"**Multi-constellation reception**: Supports L1 signals from GPS, BeiDou, "
"Galileo, QZSS, and GLONASS."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:19
msgid ""
"**便于主机集成**：通过 UART 输出 UBX-NAV-PVT 数据，默认波特率 115200 bps。"
msgstr ""
"**Straightforward host integration**: Outputs UBX-NAV-PVT over UART at a "
"default 115200 bps."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:20
msgid "**集成磁力计**：内置 QMC5883L，通过 I2C 接口连接主机。"
msgstr ""
"**Integrated magnetometer**: Includes a QMC5883L with an I2C interface to "
"the host."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:22
msgid "工作方式"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:24
msgid ""
"HM-G51B 接收 GNSS 卫星信号并完成普通单点定位，通过 UART 向飞控、车载设备、资"
"产定位终端或嵌入式主控输出 UBX-NAV-PVT 数据。"
msgstr ""
"The HM-G51B performs standard GNSS single-point positioning and outputs UBX-"
"NAV-PVT over UART to flight controllers, in-vehicle systems, asset trackers, "
"or embedded hosts."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:27
msgid ""
"产品边界 HM-G51B 提供普通单点定位，**不属于 RTK 差分定位产品**。需要厘米级定"
"位时请选择 HM-D20 或 HM-D13 系列。"
msgstr ""
"Product scope: HM-G51B provides standard single-point positioning and **is "
"not an RTK receiver**. For centimeter-level positioning, choose the HM-D20 "
"or HM-D13 series."

