#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:56
msgid ""
"HM-G51B 使用 6-pin MX1.25 mm 接口，提供电源、UART 和磁力计 I2C 信号；接口不提"
"供 PPS 引脚。"
msgstr ""
"The HM-G51B uses a 6-pin MX1.25 mm interface, providing power, UART, and "
"magnetometer I2C signals; the interface does not provide a PPS pin."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:58
msgid "适用场景与前提"
msgstr "Applications and requirements"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-g51b.md:60
msgid ""
"适合车载导航、车队管理、资产追踪、AVL/LBS、无人机普通定位和紧凑型终端。需要厘"
"米级定位或差分链路时，应选择 HM-D20 或 HM-D13 系列。"
msgstr ""
"Suitable for in-vehicle navigation, fleet management, asset tracking, AVL/"
"LBS, standard UAV positioning, and compact terminals. Choose the HM-D20 or "
"HM-D13 series when centimeter-level positioning or a correction link is "
"required."

